     If successful, pptthhrreeaadd__rreessuummee__nnpp() function returns 0.  Otherwise, an er‐
     ror number is returned to indicate the error.

EERRRROORRSS
     The pptthhrreeaadd__rreessuummee__nnpp() function will fail if:

     [EINVAL]           The value specified by the _t_i_d argument is invalid.

     [ESRCH]            No thread could be found corresponding to the thread
                        ID specified by the _t_i_d argument.

